    "body": "So actually we should remove this:\r\n\r\n- https://drafts.csswg.org/css-contain-2/#eventdef-element-contentvisibilityautostatechange already defines the event; we shouldn't have multiple such `<dfn>`s in the ecosystem.\r\n\r\n- The table says \"The following table lists events fired by this document, excluding those already defined in [media element events](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#mediaevents) and [drag-and-drop events](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dndevents).\". I'm not sure this is followed perfectly, but we should probably follow it.\r\n\r\nThis means we'll add an xref to the definitions section pointing to https://drafts.csswg.org/css-contain-2/#eventdef-element-contentvisibilityautostatechange .",
